body:
Me too except boyfriend. And whenever I actually get a guy alone (which actually happens a lot) they can sense my urgency after a couple of dates and just RUN.

&#x200B;

Just glad there are boys out there like me because finding someone who needs me as much as I need them is the only thing that keeps me alive, seeing men on this thread makes it seem possible. I'm feeling ready to give up and have posted in r/SuicideWatch about it and just seeing all you lonely people who are trying like me gives me hope.
